  "solution": "**Logic followed here is that the sum of digit is same and equal to 15**\n\nGiven, \n\n**339 – 663 – 555**\n\n**3 + 3 + 9 = 15**\n\n**6 + 6 + 3 = 15**\n\n**5 + 5 + 5 = 15**\n\n**For, 348 – 636 – 555**\n\n**3 + 4 + 8 = 15**\n\n**6 + 6 + 3 = 15**\n\n** 5 + 5 + 5 = 15**\n\nCheck the option,\n\nOption 1 - 161 – 512 – 710\n\n1 + 6 + 1 = 8 ≠ 15\n\n5 + 1 + 2 = 8 ≠ 15\n\n7 + 1 + 0 = 8 ≠ 15\n\nOption 2 - 164 – 542 – 614\n\n1 + 6 + 4 = 11 ≠ 15\n\n5 + 4 + 2 = 11 ≠ 15\n\n6 + 1 + 4 = 11 ≠ 15\n\n**Option 3 - 195 – 285 – 348**\n\n**1 + 9 + 5 = 15**\n\n**2 + 8 + 5 = 15**\n\n**3 + 4 + 8 = 15**\n\nOption 4 - 432 – 513 – 711\n\n4 + 3 + 2 = 9 ≠ 15\n\n5 + 1 + 3 = 9 ≠ 15\n\n7 + 1 + 1 = 9 ≠ 15\n\nOption 3 follow the pattern.\n\nHence the correct answer is **Option 3.**",
